<BaseLayout {title} {description} canonical="https://voxelcurve.com/about"><section class="hero"><div class="container prose"><h1>About VoxelCurve</h1><p>VoxelCurve is an independent browser-based building utility that turns block geometry into practical construction plans. The project focuses on circles, ovals and domes, with exact row and layer instructions instead of decorative 3D previews.</p><h2>Built for practical construction</h2><p>The core geometry runs locally in your browser. No account is required, and build progress is stored only on the current device.</p><h2>Independent project</h2><p>VoxelCurve is not affiliated with Mojang Studios or Microsoft.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
